+# Billing support
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` classifies a message containing the exact lowercase substring
+`refund` as `refund-review`. Every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+This classification does not establish refund eligibility or authorization, invoice status,
+or invoice details.

